  "name": "Clean Web-to-Markdown and TokenSlimmer RAG Preprocessor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Clean Web-to-Markdown & TokenSlimmer RAG Preprocessor\n\n**Who it's for:** AI engineers and automation builders ingesting web pages into RAG vector stores (Qdrant, Pinecone, Supabase) or LLM workflows.\n\n**What it does:**\n1. Fetches any public URL via `POST https://topaigateway.com/v1/extract` and strips ads, scripts, cookie banners, and navigation clutter into clean Markdown in <30ms.\n2. Runs deterministic AST compression via `POST https://topaigateway.com/v1/compress` to trim redundant tokens before calling OpenAI/Anthropic.\n\n**Setup:** No credentials are required to test on the free public sandbox. Replace the sample URL in the Extract node or add an optional `Authorization: Bearer <TOPAI_API_KEY>` header for high-volume quotas.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "sticky-note-topai-rag",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
